.TH DNSCACHE 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.6.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dnscache \- caching recursive DNS resolver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dnscache
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a DNSSEC-validating recursive resolver over UDP and TCP.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B IP, PORT
Listen address and port (defaults: 127.0.0.1 and 53).
.TP
.B ALLOW_NETS
Comma-separated client CIDRs; defaults to IPv4 and IPv6 loopback.
.TP
.B ROOTS
Path to the root hints file.  Forwarding zones may also be configured as
documented in
.BR rgbdns (7).
.TP
.B CACHESIZE
Response cache size, from 1024 through 1073741824 (default: 16777216).
.TP
.B NSCACHESIZE
Nameserver cache entries, from 16 through 1048576 (default: 4096).
.TP
.B RECURSION_LIMIT , NS_RECURSION_LIMIT
Recursion limits (defaults: 64 and 32; range: 1 through 128).
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Logging filter (default: warn).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dnscache-conf (1),
.BR dnsqr (1)
